OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with  
OL,8,Frain in the west this evening with     
OL,9,Fstrong winds towards the coast and     
OL,10,Fover hills, gale force at times.       
OL,11,FElsewhere, remaining dry with clear    
OL,12,Fspells developing in the east allowing 
OL,13,Ftemperatures to drop below freezing,   
OL,14,Fturning frosty.                        
OL,16,GTuesday:FA chilly start for most,      
OL,17,Ffrosty further north and east. Rain in 
OL,18,Fthe west, spreading across Scotland    
OL,19,Fturning to hill snow, with strong      
OL,20,Fcoastal winds, while sunshine favours  
OL,21,FEast Anglia.                           
