OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GOutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain  
OL,8,Fand hill snow persists in Scotland.    
OL,9,FDrier on Thursday with sunny spells,   
OL,10,Fthough showers along North Sea coasts, 
OL,11,Fbefore wet and windy weather returns   
OL,12,Ffrom the west through Friday.          
